<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Temporarily Unavailable — Kalpavruksha Kalyana</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
           font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #fbf4e4; color: #3a2a1c; padding: 24px; }
    .box { max-width: 440px; text-align: center; background: #fffdfa; border: 1px solid #e6d6ad;
           border-top: 4px solid #eab308; border-radius: 10px; padding: 36px 28px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #0f5c54; }
    p { font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #6b5638; margin: 0 0 6px; }
    a { display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: #eab308;
        color: #0a3835; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>We're temporarily unavailable</h1>
    <p>Something on our end (usually the database) is briefly unreachable.</p>
    <p>This isn't something wrong on your side — please try again in a few minutes.</p>
    <a href="/">Try again</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
